WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:39.320
Or someone is using this
to harm the prince,

01:39.400 --> 01:42.240
it all goes
to the Palace Investigation Bureau

01:42.320 --> 01:44.680
for a thorough investigation!

01:45.280 --> 01:46.840
Physician Liu,

01:46.920 --> 01:48.680
ultimately,

01:48.760 --> 01:50.720
you'll have

01:51.480 --> 01:53.640
to explain it yourself.

02:02.680 --> 02:03.800
No.

02:03.880 --> 02:06.080
This prescription can't be wrong.

02:06.640 --> 02:07.800
Did you mix something up?

02:08.520 --> 02:09.560
No, it can't be.

02:09.639 --> 02:11.400
My master checked it.

02:11.480 --> 02:13.440
He scolded me for being stubborn.

02:14.040 --> 02:17.000
But it wouldn't kill anyone
even if it's strong.

02:20.120 --> 02:21.080
Let me out.

02:21.160 --> 02:22.320
I want to see Liu Jia's body.

02:22.400 --> 02:23.240
I need to know the truth.

02:24.040 --> 02:26.120
To stop the epidemic from spreading,

02:26.200 --> 02:27.560
the Imperial Medical Office
burned the bodies.

02:30.000 --> 02:32.160
Then I'll never clear my name.

02:33.360 --> 02:35.560
Instead of proving
that eunuch is at fault,

02:35.640 --> 02:38.040
find a way to prove your medicine works.

02:39.640 --> 02:42.560
Your Ladyship, please get me a set
of used bowls and chopsticks.

02:44.680 --> 02:46.440
No one has ever
ordered me around like this.

02:47.720 --> 02:49.280
I spoke out of turn, Your Ladyship.

02:50.080 --> 02:52.040
But I'm not doing this
to compete with Supervisor Huang.

02:53.000 --> 02:53.960
This epidemic shows no mercy.

02:54.040 --> 02:55.560
We can't lose anyone else.

02:56.160 --> 02:58.320
Saving lives comes first. I'll help you.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.960
Pei Yu, Her Ladyship gave you this.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.240
Be careful with it.

03:18.520 --> 03:21.280
PRESCRIPTION

03:38.160 --> 03:40.320
- Where's Her Ladyship?
- She went back to her room to sleep.

03:40.400 --> 03:42.080
She's usually up past the Hai Hour.

03:42.160 --> 03:43.320
Why did she turn in so early tonight?

03:58.640 --> 03:59.480
You're sick?

04:03.600 --> 04:04.440
Your Ladyship?

04:05.080 --> 04:05.920
Open the door!

04:07.720 --> 04:08.760
I'm fine.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.200
I'm still alive.

04:11.920 --> 04:13.640
Li Peiyi? Open up!

04:31.480 --> 04:32.760
How dare you

04:33.280 --> 04:34.600
call me by my full name?

04:36.000 --> 04:36.960
Don't hide.

04:43.400 --> 04:44.560
You're burning up.

05:01.640 --> 05:03.280
Why is it so bad?

05:03.360 --> 05:04.880
Did you catch it in Lady Su's palace?

05:05.720 --> 05:07.080
No. We can't waste time.

05:07.160 --> 05:08.120
I'll go get Physician Liu.

05:08.200 --> 05:09.480
Mr. Xiao, wait!

05:12.360 --> 05:14.320
What's the use of finding
the imperial physicians?

05:15.160 --> 05:17.440
We both know
there's no cure for this right now.

05:19.240 --> 05:20.440
If I'm not meant to die,

05:21.480 --> 05:23.160
I'll make it through this.

05:24.600 --> 05:26.040
But if I can't escape it…

05:27.760 --> 05:28.800
Don't talk like that.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.000
I'll call the imperial physicians.

05:31.520 --> 05:32.440
Once they arrive,

05:34.360 --> 05:35.720
it won't be easy for me

05:36.440 --> 05:37.320
to see you again.

05:41.040 --> 05:42.360
You know

05:43.080 --> 05:44.800
what haunts me most

05:45.840 --> 05:48.120
is the truth behind the massacre
at the Prince of Duan's manor.

05:53.040 --> 05:54.280
If I die,

05:55.600 --> 05:57.680
please uncover the truth for me.

06:01.440 --> 06:03.320
You're thoughtful,

06:04.320 --> 06:05.920
kind, and sharp.

06:06.960 --> 06:08.080
I trust you.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.320
You won't agree?

06:30.760 --> 06:32.920
You never speak straight.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.240
Forgive me. I can't promise.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.160
If you won't, fine.

06:41.600 --> 06:42.920
After I'm gone,

06:44.040 --> 06:45.640
you won't let me down.

06:51.640 --> 06:52.760
But then,

06:54.760 --> 06:56.440
you wouldn't even
agree with me saying that.

07:14.880 --> 07:17.000
That old man Du Zhixing

07:17.920 --> 07:19.440
never lets anyone rest easy.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.720
He looks tough,

07:22.880 --> 07:25.600
but all these years,
he's ruined his health.

07:28.000 --> 07:29.360
If I die,

07:30.880 --> 07:33.320
promise me you won't
mess with him using poison again.

07:34.840 --> 07:36.480
And make him drink less too.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.560
That girl Wuren

07:41.400 --> 07:43.240
has gotten better at cases.

07:45.080 --> 07:46.440
I'm not worried.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.760
Prosecutor Gu is a good man.

07:52.840 --> 07:55.040
If one day she wants to marry him,

07:56.560 --> 07:58.440
you need to vet him for me.

08:01.040 --> 08:01.960
Wait for me.

08:04.280 --> 08:05.240
Mr. Xiao!

08:08.360 --> 08:10.400
You want me to gamble with fate?

08:13.200 --> 08:14.640
You're just lucky.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.480
Thank goodness
that arranged marriage wasn't binding.

08:18.160 --> 08:19.840
Otherwise, if I really died,

08:20.640 --> 08:24.360
you'd be a widower at such a young age.

08:49.560 --> 08:51.840
These past few days,
more people have fallen ill.

08:51.920 --> 08:53.480
Our medical officials
have gone to the palaces.

08:53.560 --> 08:55.240
No one's left to make house calls.

08:59.960 --> 09:01.800
If she runs a fever, she should drink
this Minor Bupleurum Decoction.

09:01.880 --> 09:04.440
If she coughs or her throat hurts,
she should take these pills.

09:04.520 --> 09:06.080
This is all we can do for now.

09:06.160 --> 09:08.520
Tomorrow morning,
if any medical officials return,

09:08.600 --> 09:09.800
they'll go
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

09:23.400 --> 09:24.320
Your Ladyship,

09:24.840 --> 09:26.080
the imperial physicians
are all out on calls.

09:26.160 --> 09:28.040
Here's something for fever and throat.

09:28.840 --> 09:30.000
Take them for now.

09:32.200 --> 09:34.080
We both know they won't help.

09:35.120 --> 09:37.560
They can't cure it, and they taste awful.

09:38.280 --> 09:39.440
That's what really makes me suffer.

09:40.160 --> 09:41.560
If you're truly miserable,

09:42.360 --> 09:43.480
don't hold back.

09:47.600 --> 09:49.240
No medicine beats getting a good sleep.

09:51.000 --> 09:52.720
You should rest too.

09:53.480 --> 09:56.000
If you catch the epidemic because of me,
it won't be worth it.

11:11.040 --> 11:12.920
So much for "I don't believe in that."

11:14.240 --> 11:16.320
Looks like he's scared I'll die.

11:27.760 --> 11:28.960
You didn't catch a chill, did you?

11:31.560 --> 11:34.120
Last night, you fell asleep in the yard.

11:34.200 --> 11:35.760
Her Ladyship told us to carry you back.

11:36.720 --> 11:38.160
Her Ladyship is already sick.

11:38.680 --> 11:39.760
You can't fall ill too.

11:41.440 --> 11:42.360
Thank you.

11:42.440 --> 11:43.400
How is Her Ladyship?

11:45.120 --> 11:46.400
She won't let us see her.

11:58.280 --> 12:00.080
To clear my name,

12:00.160 --> 12:02.680
you even made yourself get infected
to test my medicine.

12:03.280 --> 12:04.560
I will do everything I can…

12:10.320 --> 12:12.680
Mr. Xiao, you visited
the Imperial Medical Office.

12:13.280 --> 12:14.480
Since no physicians can treat me,

12:15.080 --> 12:16.400
let Technician Pei try.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.120
In that case,

12:23.200 --> 12:26.520
Technician Pei, please do
everything you can to treat Her Ladyship.

12:36.920 --> 12:38.120
He's so kind.

12:40.200 --> 12:41.840
If I die by your hand,

12:42.400 --> 12:43.960
then no one can help you anymore.

13:00.720 --> 13:02.360
Why are you coughing so hard?

13:05.920 --> 13:08.560
Does Pei Yu's medicine even work?

13:09.480 --> 13:10.680
Put it down. Go.

13:14.600 --> 13:16.600
You wouldn't let me see you.

13:17.320 --> 13:18.920
Even just one day,

13:19.000 --> 13:20.760
I missed you like crazy.

13:21.680 --> 13:23.000
How can you be so heartless?

13:24.160 --> 13:26.160
I'm not fully better yet.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.400
I just didn't want you to catch it.

13:30.520 --> 13:31.560
I got this from the Imperial Food Service.

13:32.200 --> 13:33.200
It's cold and sweet.

13:33.280 --> 13:35.560
It'll soothe your throat.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.680
Take your medicine first.

13:54.280 --> 13:56.200
Stop waiting for him. Mr. Xiao

13:56.280 --> 13:58.080
left early this morning.

13:59.880 --> 14:00.720
No.

14:01.400 --> 14:02.920
He didn't ask if you're feeling better?

14:05.160 --> 14:06.720
And you aren't curious whether I'm better?

14:10.240 --> 14:11.080
Fever's gone.

14:12.080 --> 14:13.040
My cough's much better too.

14:15.920 --> 14:17.360
You were coughing so hard earlier.

14:17.960 --> 14:18.800
So you were faking it.

14:34.120 --> 14:35.400
Mr. Xiao, you're back.

14:56.560 --> 14:58.120
From your pulse,

14:59.560 --> 15:00.880
you have recovered.

15:01.480 --> 15:03.760
For the next few days,
eat some nourishing foods,

15:03.840 --> 15:05.280
and you'll be back to normal.

15:05.920 --> 15:07.320
How do you feel, Your Ladyship?

15:08.160 --> 15:09.480
Much lighter.

15:10.000 --> 15:11.880
I didn't cough at all last night.

15:11.960 --> 15:13.000
Slept till dawn.

15:14.640 --> 15:16.080
I told you my medicine was fine.

15:21.120 --> 15:22.560
Tell Mr. Xiao

15:22.640 --> 15:23.640
I'm not dying anytime soon.

15:24.880 --> 15:27.280
Mr. Xiao left early this morning.

15:29.640 --> 15:31.160
He didn't ask about me at all?

15:36.920 --> 15:38.760
He's just calm and reserved.

15:39.280 --> 15:40.720
He must've known I'd recover.

15:42.800 --> 15:44.960
Your Ladyship, you're done for.

15:45.040 --> 15:47.560
Now you even make excuses for him.

15:59.240 --> 16:01.640
That day, a supervisor
from the Imperial Medical Office came.

16:01.720 --> 16:03.680
He'd draw lots to pick someone
to test the medicine.

16:03.760 --> 16:07.120
He carried a bamboo basket
filled with folded slips.

16:07.200 --> 16:09.520
He said whoever drew a slip
with writing would go test it.

16:10.120 --> 16:11.680
Everyone drew?

16:11.760 --> 16:14.880
Yes. At first, a dozen were blank.

16:15.400 --> 16:17.360
Until Liu Jia drew one with writing.

16:17.440 --> 16:19.480
Everyone envied him at first,

16:20.000 --> 16:22.480
until they heard the drug killed him.

16:23.080 --> 16:24.080
Then they all got scared.

16:25.000 --> 16:26.440
Did you see what the slip looked like?

16:26.520 --> 16:28.840
On Liu Jia's slip, there was a character.

16:28.920 --> 16:31.200
Everyone tried to get a look.

16:31.280 --> 16:32.840
But Liu Jia said his hands were wet,

16:32.920 --> 16:35.360
and the paper got damp and tore,
so he tossed it.

16:36.200 --> 16:37.640
What did the supervisor look like?

16:37.720 --> 16:39.320
A man.

16:40.000 --> 16:41.840
He had a scar
on the back of his right hand.

16:44.000 --> 16:44.960
Got it.

16:50.320 --> 16:51.960
Greetings, Your Majesty, Your Highness.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.520
You're really recovered!

17:01.560 --> 17:03.040
Look at you.

17:03.560 --> 17:04.800
You got sick and didn't say a word.

17:04.880 --> 17:06.839
Only told us after you got better.

17:12.480 --> 17:14.680
I'm here today to beg forgiveness.

17:14.760 --> 17:16.280
With the palace gates sealed,

17:16.359 --> 17:18.040
you still managed to stir up trouble.

17:18.960 --> 17:20.280
I didn't cause a disaster this time.

17:20.359 --> 17:21.599
Let's hear it.

17:22.880 --> 17:25.599
Last time we tested the new prescription,
a eunuch died suddenly.

17:25.680 --> 17:27.640
Yet the Physicians
at the Imperial Medical Office

17:27.720 --> 17:30.360
all said this prescription
wouldn't cause such a violent outcome.

17:31.080 --> 17:32.640
To verify it again,

17:33.680 --> 17:35.040
I chose to infect myself

17:35.120 --> 17:37.160
and asked Technician Pei to treat me,

17:37.240 --> 17:38.360
using the same prescription.

17:40.440 --> 17:42.840
I acted first and reported later,
so I'm here to apologize.

17:45.760 --> 17:47.680
You were far too reckless.

17:47.760 --> 17:49.320
Good thing you recovered.

17:49.400 --> 17:50.800
Truly a stroke of luck.

17:52.520 --> 17:56.080
Since this was to verify
the new prescription

17:56.160 --> 17:57.200
and ease Your Majesty's burden,

17:57.280 --> 17:58.880
then please don't punish her.

18:03.680 --> 18:04.600
Get up.

18:08.000 --> 18:09.200
Look at you.

18:09.280 --> 18:11.960
You made me and Consort Shu worry sick.

18:12.040 --> 18:14.480
That's a crime!
And crimes deserve punishment!

18:14.560 --> 18:17.200
But… not today.

18:17.840 --> 18:20.400
Where's the one
who wrote the prescription?

18:20.480 --> 18:23.000
She's only a woman technician.

18:23.080 --> 18:24.240
She's waiting outside.

18:28.800 --> 18:30.920
Summon the technician!

18:39.720 --> 18:40.760
Your Majesty.

18:41.360 --> 18:44.080
This guilty subject, Pei Yu,
pays respects to Your Majesty.

18:44.680 --> 18:45.880
Look up and speak.

18:48.480 --> 18:51.120
Is this prescription
the same as last time?

18:51.200 --> 18:53.680
What Her Ladyship took
was the same as last time.

18:53.760 --> 18:56.200
Then why did it kill someone last time?

18:57.680 --> 18:59.280
Your Majesty, because that man

18:59.360 --> 19:01.040
already had a severe stomach illness.

19:01.120 --> 19:03.720
These past few days,
I've spoken to his coworkers.

19:03.800 --> 19:06.720
They all knew
he'd suffered from it for years.

19:06.800 --> 19:09.040
The records show it as well.

19:09.560 --> 19:11.520
When I took his pulse before the test,

19:11.600 --> 19:13.480
I could tell he had stomach trouble.

19:13.560 --> 19:14.920
But it didn't seem serious.

19:15.000 --> 19:17.840
It seems he took stomach medicine
before the test.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.880
I adjusted the prescription,

19:19.960 --> 19:22.000
but he still couldn't handle the strain,

19:22.080 --> 19:23.000
so…

19:24.040 --> 19:26.080
So the problem wasn't the prescription,

19:26.160 --> 19:27.680
but the hidden condition,

19:27.760 --> 19:29.560
which affected Technician Pei's diagnosis.

19:31.080 --> 19:32.040
With this medicine,

19:32.720 --> 19:35.280
can Jing handle it?

19:35.360 --> 19:37.560
Before treating the young prince,

19:37.640 --> 19:39.360
I'll review the pulse records
from these days

19:39.440 --> 19:40.960
and his current condition.

19:47.840 --> 19:51.400
Good. Then my son is in your hands.

19:52.560 --> 19:54.360
I won't fail Your Majesty!

20:07.040 --> 20:08.240
You've recovered?

20:08.840 --> 20:11.400
Yes. Thanks to Technician Pei's medicine.

20:17.440 --> 20:20.400
And thank you, too,
for getting help that night.

20:21.440 --> 20:23.400
It was nothing.

20:23.480 --> 20:25.040
If it were me who fell ill,

20:25.120 --> 20:27.480
I'm sure you would do the same.

20:35.320 --> 20:36.480
I have to say it, after all.

20:37.720 --> 20:38.680
Mr. Xiao,

20:39.800 --> 20:43.680
I got infected on purpose to help
prove Technician Pei's prescription.

20:44.280 --> 20:46.720
I promised you before
I wouldn't hurt myself again,

20:46.800 --> 20:48.480
but I broke it.

20:49.000 --> 20:50.600
Say what you want.

20:50.680 --> 20:52.080
I won't make excuses.

20:53.040 --> 20:54.760
I trusted Technician Pei…

20:56.400 --> 20:58.800
but I didn't know if I'd live.

21:00.880 --> 21:02.760
I lied to you about why I got sick.

21:03.280 --> 21:06.240
But what I said back then
was all from the heart.

21:06.840 --> 21:08.080
If you're angry,

21:08.600 --> 21:09.800
I don't blame you.

21:10.560 --> 21:11.720
But…

21:14.560 --> 21:16.000
being sick is awful.

21:16.080 --> 21:16.960
Don't ever get sick.

21:22.320 --> 21:25.400
I've seen you risk your own body
for the cases.

21:26.160 --> 21:28.600
And I always thought it looked brave

21:28.680 --> 21:29.880
yet somewhat reckless.

21:30.760 --> 21:31.800
But this time,

21:31.880 --> 21:34.080
I finally get your intention.

21:34.680 --> 21:35.880
In this deep palace,

21:36.400 --> 21:38.640
sometimes only a do-or-die move

21:38.720 --> 21:41.760
can lead you to the truth and save lives.

21:45.760 --> 21:47.120
You're flattering me.

21:47.880 --> 21:49.080
I'm not that noble.

21:50.280 --> 21:51.880
My position just grants me

21:52.440 --> 21:53.680
more room to act than others have.

21:54.600 --> 21:56.440
I'm anxious about the epidemic here.
That's true.

21:57.200 --> 21:59.440
I wanted to help Pei Yu
prove the prescription. That's true too.

22:00.040 --> 22:02.280
I'm not afraid of death. That's true.

22:03.560 --> 22:04.480
But I'm afraid…

22:10.120 --> 22:11.000
Don't be.

22:11.520 --> 22:13.440
You drew an auspicious hexagram.

22:13.520 --> 22:14.720
I knew I'd be fine.

22:16.320 --> 22:18.120
You didn't come to check on me those days,

22:18.200 --> 22:19.880
so I thought you were mad.

22:19.960 --> 22:22.040
Turns out I was being petty.

22:22.120 --> 22:24.920
You were investigating
that eunuch who tested the medicine.

22:27.080 --> 22:29.240
If I were hovering around you all day,

22:29.320 --> 22:30.920
you wouldn't have recovered this fast.

22:32.840 --> 22:34.720
You wanted to clear Technician Pei's name.

22:34.800 --> 22:36.120
All I could do was a small thing

22:36.720 --> 22:39.440
to prove that failed test
wasn't entirely her fault.

22:40.160 --> 22:42.760
Liu Jia being picked to test it
wasn't a coincidence.

22:43.360 --> 22:44.200
Right.

22:44.280 --> 22:46.480
The one who came to pick someone
was Huang Futong.

22:47.880 --> 22:50.480
You chose Liu Jia on purpose, didn't you?

22:51.080 --> 22:52.360
So you're saying

22:52.440 --> 22:55.960
his death from Pei Yu's prescription
was my scheme?

22:59.520 --> 23:01.640
That woman can barely practice medicine,

23:01.720 --> 23:03.680
yet her witchcraft is impressive.

23:03.760 --> 23:05.560
Everyone's defending her.

23:07.280 --> 23:09.280
Pei Yu's prescription is harsh.

23:09.360 --> 23:11.000
To keep her from rising,

23:11.080 --> 23:13.080
you found Liu Jia
infected with the epidemic

23:13.160 --> 23:14.440
and with a stomach disease on top of it.

23:16.720 --> 23:18.080
How ridiculous.

23:18.920 --> 23:21.040
I do one rotation every three months,

23:21.120 --> 23:23.800
and I've treated countless.

23:23.880 --> 23:25.400
How would I know who has stomach trouble?

23:25.480 --> 23:28.560
Besides, the patient
was picked by drawing lots.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.760
It was fate.

23:37.680 --> 23:38.600
HUANG FUTONG

23:39.560 --> 23:40.560
Fate…

23:41.640 --> 23:42.640
like this?

23:45.120 --> 23:47.280
I don't know what "magic" you're playing,

23:47.360 --> 23:49.960
but if you have solid proof

23:50.040 --> 23:52.000
that I rigged anything,

23:52.080 --> 23:53.320
I'll plead guilty.

23:54.120 --> 23:55.240
Otherwise,

23:55.320 --> 23:57.600
I'd ask you to stay away
from the Medical Office.

23:58.200 --> 24:00.160
We're already short-handed.

24:00.240 --> 24:03.000
If you delay treatment for the nobles,

24:03.080 --> 24:05.400
you won't be able to bear that blame.

24:08.440 --> 24:09.680
It's alum.

24:10.720 --> 24:12.040
The Medical Office has plenty of that.

24:12.640 --> 24:16.640
I suspect Huang Futong used alum water
to write on every slip,

24:16.720 --> 24:20.240
then tricked Liu Jia to wet his fingertip
before the draw.

24:20.320 --> 24:22.240
That way, no matter which slip he took,

24:22.320 --> 24:24.400
the hidden ink would show.

24:25.680 --> 24:27.080
But Liu Jia is dead,

24:27.160 --> 24:30.000
and the slips from that draw
have long vanished.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.640
Master!

24:35.440 --> 24:36.600
Master!

24:38.560 --> 24:40.360
Still steaming your eyes now?

24:41.640 --> 24:42.960
Master?

24:59.440 --> 25:00.760
Master?

25:02.480 --> 25:03.440
Master?

25:04.480 --> 25:05.760
Master?

25:08.760 --> 25:10.280
Master…

25:14.080 --> 25:15.400
Master…

25:27.080 --> 25:28.880
When you arrived,
Physician Song was like this?

25:33.800 --> 25:34.800
No.

25:35.520 --> 25:36.520
When I came in,

25:37.160 --> 25:38.560
Master had a cloth over his head.

25:39.160 --> 25:40.640
He had an eye illness.

25:40.720 --> 25:42.400
Every night before bed,

25:42.480 --> 25:44.720
he would steam his eyes
with this decoction.

25:44.800 --> 25:48.040
He leaned over the basin
and let the steam bathe his eyes.

25:48.640 --> 25:49.640
It's been cold lately.

25:49.720 --> 25:52.520
With a warm cloth on top,
the water would cool more slowly.

25:58.120 --> 25:59.440
Could there be something wrong
with this medicine?

26:00.040 --> 26:01.760
I know Master's formula.

26:19.600 --> 26:20.440
It wasn't the problem.

26:22.000 --> 26:23.200
Then this decoction?

26:23.280 --> 26:26.080
If there were an issue,
Master would've noticed.

26:26.160 --> 26:28.240
And it was mild in nature.

26:28.320 --> 26:30.560
No clashing ingredients in it.

26:31.760 --> 26:33.720
Did he steam his eyes every night?

26:34.720 --> 26:35.720
Yes.

26:36.320 --> 26:37.320
Who knew about this?

26:38.040 --> 26:39.480
Everyone at the Medical Office knew.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.840
Technician Pei,
please step outside with me.

26:54.400 --> 26:55.760
Without her master's protection,

26:55.840 --> 26:57.760
with that blunt temperament,

26:57.840 --> 26:59.520
it'll be even harder for her there.

27:07.600 --> 27:09.400
Had Physician Song been acting odd lately?

27:10.760 --> 27:13.000
The epidemic can't be contained.

27:13.520 --> 27:15.640
Every day, Master was working
on new prescriptions.

27:15.720 --> 27:18.160
Last night I spoke with him a bit,

27:18.240 --> 27:19.560
then someone called him away.

27:20.160 --> 27:21.040
What time was that?

27:21.720 --> 27:24.280
Around… half past the Xu Hour.

27:24.920 --> 27:26.080
Did you see him after that?

27:29.520 --> 27:30.520
The next time

27:31.400 --> 27:32.640
was just now.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.120
Your Ladyship.

28:08.120 --> 28:09.040
Your Ladyship,

28:09.880 --> 28:11.880
this wasn't caused by medication.

28:12.800 --> 28:15.240
His eyes were bloodshot, his ears flushed.

28:15.320 --> 28:18.280
Likely from a violent surge
of qi and blood inside.

28:18.880 --> 28:20.160
A sudden stroke?

28:20.760 --> 28:21.840
That's right.

28:21.920 --> 28:23.400
He passed out in an instant,

28:23.480 --> 28:25.280
and his face fell into the decoction.

28:25.360 --> 28:27.560
When it hit, he still had a faint breath,

28:27.640 --> 28:30.640
but couldn't save himself and drowned.

28:31.280 --> 28:33.680
He was in his prime.
How could he have a stroke so suddenly?

28:34.280 --> 28:36.640
Physician Song already had
a tendency toward strokes.

28:36.720 --> 28:39.080
With the epidemic, he was swamped.
No sleep, no rest.

28:39.680 --> 28:41.320
So it struck him all at once.

28:41.400 --> 28:43.720
Pei Yu! Physician Song
died because of you!

28:43.800 --> 28:45.480
Huang Futong! Don't lay a hand on her!

28:49.360 --> 28:51.560
You've never obeyed Physician Song.

28:51.640 --> 28:53.600
He must've stopped you
from crossing the line,

28:53.680 --> 28:54.920
so you killed him!

28:55.000 --> 28:56.160
Nonsense!

28:56.240 --> 28:57.240
I have proof!

29:00.720 --> 29:01.600
Your Ladyship.

29:02.240 --> 29:05.400
I saw Pei Yu arguing with Physician Song
in the dispensary last night.

29:05.480 --> 29:08.160
I couldn't hear clearly
what they were saying,

29:08.240 --> 29:11.040
but his last words were loud and clear.

29:11.120 --> 29:12.480
What did he say?

29:12.560 --> 29:13.920
He said,

29:14.000 --> 29:15.320
"Only over my dead body!"

29:16.080 --> 29:18.920
- So you killed him!
- I didn't kill my master!

29:19.000 --> 29:21.520
Supervisor Huang said you argued.

29:21.600 --> 29:22.560
Is that true?

29:24.880 --> 29:25.760
I…

29:26.640 --> 29:28.560
Yes, I argued with Master.

29:28.640 --> 29:31.040
Master and I have always argued like that.

29:31.720 --> 29:33.800
Sometimes we say harsh things.

29:33.880 --> 29:36.040
But how could I kill him for that?

29:36.120 --> 29:37.120
Still lying, are you?

29:37.640 --> 29:39.080
We've already checked.

29:39.160 --> 29:42.640
Physician Song died of a sudden illness.

29:42.720 --> 29:43.720
No one killed him!

29:43.800 --> 29:46.600
But his stroke-related illness
had persisted for over ten years.

29:46.680 --> 29:47.880
He was always fine.

29:47.960 --> 29:50.080
If not for working
himself to death lately,

29:50.160 --> 29:52.680
how would he die so young? So suddenly?

29:52.760 --> 29:55.160
If you'd noticed sooner

29:55.240 --> 29:57.200
it wasn't a cold but the epidemic,

29:57.280 --> 29:58.880
you could've eased his burden.

29:58.960 --> 30:00.960
He wouldn't have worked himself to death.

30:01.480 --> 30:02.800
- You…
- Enough!

30:04.240 --> 30:05.160
Your Ladyship,

30:05.240 --> 30:06.400
Physician Song's sudden death

30:07.000 --> 30:09.280
leaves Supervisor Huang
overwhelmed with grief.

30:09.360 --> 30:10.480
Forgive the outburst.

30:11.560 --> 30:12.400
Leave.

30:14.960 --> 30:16.840
Treating the young prince
matters most. Go back first.

30:19.400 --> 30:20.720
I regret that.

30:21.240 --> 30:23.280
I shouldn't have given
Master that prescription

30:23.360 --> 30:24.200
and made him angry.

30:37.840 --> 30:39.920
Father, Mother, I'm done drinking it.

30:42.120 --> 30:43.800
Come on. Let's go play!

30:51.440 --> 30:52.800
Just keep it up for seven more days,

30:52.880 --> 30:54.800
dress warm, morning and night,
and he'll be fully well.

30:55.640 --> 30:58.040
We really have Technician Pei to thank.

30:58.120 --> 31:00.240
Your Majesty should reward her.

31:01.840 --> 31:03.000
Of course I will.

31:03.800 --> 31:04.760
Thank you, Your Majesty.

31:06.400 --> 31:07.720
Thank you, Lady Su.

31:14.720 --> 31:15.680
Your Majesty,

31:15.760 --> 31:18.640
Technician Pei has studied
under Physician Song since childhood.

31:18.720 --> 31:19.760
She's exceptionally gifted.

31:20.360 --> 31:23.440
She just never had the chance
to ease Your Majesty's burden.

31:25.160 --> 31:26.600
Now that the new prescription works

31:27.200 --> 31:30.000
and she understands this illness,

31:30.080 --> 31:31.600
I believe the epidemic here

31:31.680 --> 31:34.320
can be wiped out within half a month.

31:36.640 --> 31:37.560
So you're saying

31:38.240 --> 31:40.840
Technician Pei already has a cure?

31:40.920 --> 31:42.440
I'm still working on it.

31:44.000 --> 31:45.560
You're being modest.

31:46.080 --> 31:47.600
You've studied this illness

31:47.680 --> 31:48.960
and written so many notes.

31:49.040 --> 31:51.200
Everyone at the Medical Office
has seen it.

31:52.920 --> 31:55.120
Our previous treatments were too cautious.

31:55.200 --> 31:57.520
But your approach is a pleasant surprise.

31:57.600 --> 31:59.440
You'll surely overcome this epidemic!

32:00.640 --> 32:02.840
Earning Your Majesty's trust is my honor.

32:02.920 --> 32:04.840
I'll give it everything I have.

32:04.920 --> 32:08.560
If… I can't clear
the epidemic within half a month,

32:08.640 --> 32:09.960
I'll resign.

32:15.080 --> 32:16.680
She got a few compliments

32:16.760 --> 32:18.640
and thought she's something,

32:19.320 --> 32:22.440
swearing an oath
right in front of His Majesty.

32:22.960 --> 32:25.280
In half a month, she'll pack up and leave.

32:25.360 --> 32:27.760
Supervisor Huang
really knows how to play it.

32:28.280 --> 32:29.920
I've never liked her, honestly.

32:30.000 --> 32:31.040
Right?

32:31.560 --> 32:32.600
I…

32:34.680 --> 32:38.640
I worked hard to find that eunuch
with the stomach disease.

32:39.440 --> 32:41.280
I didn't expect her to be so lucky.

32:41.360 --> 32:43.040
Even the County Princess
is protecting her.

32:43.120 --> 32:46.240
I thought once she "killed" someone,
she'd be kicked out.

32:46.760 --> 32:50.120
Instead, she ended up
winning the Emperor's favor.

32:51.520 --> 32:53.560
Don't celebrate too soon.

32:53.640 --> 32:57.720
Only the end reveals fortune or ruin.

32:59.320 --> 33:01.840
Fine. We'll just endure her
for half a month.

33:07.360 --> 33:09.080
Your Ladyship, save me!

33:09.600 --> 33:11.920
Your Ladyship! Pei Yu's trying to kill me!

33:13.040 --> 33:15.440
She found out Liu Jia
was picked by you on purpose.

33:15.520 --> 33:16.960
How… How did she know?

33:18.200 --> 33:19.040
You deserve death.

33:21.680 --> 33:22.600
Your Ladyship!

33:22.680 --> 33:24.680
I did do something awful to her before,

33:24.760 --> 33:26.440
but does that make murder okay?

33:26.960 --> 33:28.120
You can't just ignore it!

33:29.160 --> 33:31.680
Look, you haven't lost a single hair.

33:31.760 --> 33:33.120
Why say she's trying to kill you?

33:33.200 --> 33:34.120
It's…

33:36.880 --> 33:37.720
Because…

33:38.480 --> 33:41.920
Because on my bed was a headless dead rat!

33:42.920 --> 33:45.000
She did that to warn me.

33:45.080 --> 33:47.960
She'll kill me the same way
she killed that rat!

33:49.320 --> 33:51.400
Your Ladyship, it's right there!

34:02.400 --> 34:03.640
You're a supervisor.

34:03.720 --> 34:06.520
Can't you tell the cut isn't from a blade,

34:06.600 --> 34:08.800
but from a cat or weasel's teeth?

34:09.480 --> 34:11.880
Maybe that witch trained it?

34:13.159 --> 34:15.719
Then summon Pei Yu and confront her.

34:17.000 --> 34:18.199
Forget it.

34:18.800 --> 34:20.280
If you're truly scared,

34:20.360 --> 34:22.120
come back with us
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

34:22.199 --> 34:23.400
We'll keep you safe.

34:23.920 --> 34:24.960
Really?

34:25.040 --> 34:26.239
You killed Liu Jia.

34:26.320 --> 34:29.040
That's enough to rot in our prison
for the rest of your life.

34:31.719 --> 34:33.560
I spoke without thinking just now.

34:33.639 --> 34:35.600
If you want to pursue this,

34:35.679 --> 34:37.000
then show me proof.

34:38.000 --> 34:39.880
I have urgent business to attend to.

34:40.440 --> 34:41.920
Your Ladyship. Deputy Director Xiao.

34:42.880 --> 34:43.960
Take care.

35:01.520 --> 35:02.920
Someone's dead!

35:03.800 --> 35:04.800
Someone's dead!

35:06.440 --> 35:08.640
Someone's dead…

35:17.120 --> 35:18.440
You're not
from the Imperial Medical Office.

35:22.440 --> 35:23.360
Your Ladyship,

35:23.440 --> 35:24.280
‪XIA SHISAN
‪IMPERIAL FOOD SERVICE EUNUCH

35:24.360 --> 35:26.600
this servant
is from the Imperial Food Service.

35:27.480 --> 35:28.880
Did you see anyone pass by just now?

35:30.040 --> 35:30.920
I…

35:32.080 --> 35:33.360
I just came out and saw…

35:33.920 --> 35:36.760
Enough. If you remember
anything, report it at once.

35:37.800 --> 35:38.640
Understood.

35:40.360 --> 35:42.480
Before it happened, where were you two?

35:43.200 --> 35:45.160
Your Ladyship, we were in the dispensary,
sorting the new medicines.

35:45.240 --> 35:47.000
Did you notice anything unusual?

35:50.960 --> 35:52.480
When it happened,

35:52.560 --> 35:54.880
you were standing closest
to the dispensary.

35:55.480 --> 35:56.480
Did you see anything?

35:56.560 --> 35:59.000
The Imperial Medical Office
has been nonstop today,

35:59.080 --> 36:00.440
not a moment to rest.

36:00.520 --> 36:02.200
If that eunuch hadn't screamed,

36:02.280 --> 36:03.920
we'd never have known a murder happened.

36:31.680 --> 36:34.520
The killer likely used a rake
to pry up the millstone,

36:34.600 --> 36:37.080
then set one side of it
on a wooden sleeper.

36:37.160 --> 36:38.520
The millstone slid down.

36:39.120 --> 36:40.240
There was no one on the roof.

36:40.320 --> 36:43.600
The millstone must've been held in place
by some method,

36:43.680 --> 36:45.840
then dropped at the right moment
when Huang Futong showed up.

36:54.080 --> 36:55.200
So that's it.

36:55.840 --> 36:56.800
Rope.

36:58.000 --> 36:59.040
Let's check inside.

37:06.720 --> 37:08.320
This spot is perfect.

37:09.240 --> 37:11.040
With a rope from the roof into the room,

37:11.120 --> 37:13.720
someone inside can control the millstone.

37:13.800 --> 37:15.400
There were five
or six people in here then,

37:15.480 --> 37:16.440
all busy with their own work.

37:16.520 --> 37:18.000
No one likely noticed who was who.

37:18.080 --> 37:19.440
Supervisor Huang is dead!

37:20.040 --> 37:21.440
Supervisor Huang is dead!

37:21.520 --> 37:24.320
Pei Yu killed Supervisor Huang!

37:24.400 --> 37:26.480
Pei Yu killed Supervisor Huang!

37:27.080 --> 37:28.640
Your Ladyship, save me!

37:28.720 --> 37:31.000
It… It had to be Pei Yu!

37:31.080 --> 37:33.040
I can't stay here anymore. Your Ladyship!

37:33.120 --> 37:34.840
Pei Yu will kill me too!

37:35.560 --> 37:37.800
She'll kill all of you!

37:38.440 --> 37:40.440
Your Ladyship, save me!

37:43.640 --> 37:45.320
It was her.

37:45.840 --> 37:48.040
It was her!

37:48.120 --> 37:50.680
Pei Yu hasn't come back
to the Imperial Medical Office.

37:50.760 --> 37:52.800
How can you be so sure
she killed Supervisor Huang?

37:52.880 --> 37:55.720
Who knows how she did it?

37:55.800 --> 37:57.280
All I know is, if you cross her,

37:57.360 --> 37:58.640
nothing good happens.

37:58.720 --> 38:01.160
Technician Pei has been focused
on the new prescription.

38:01.240 --> 38:03.760
So what did you do to offend her?

38:06.000 --> 38:07.920
That woman really has some skill.

38:08.000 --> 38:10.160
Even Mr. Xiao speaks up for her!

38:10.760 --> 38:12.840
Quit talking nonsense out of jealousy.

38:12.920 --> 38:15.600
If you were innocent,
we'd speak up for you too.

38:17.560 --> 38:18.480
Before,

38:18.560 --> 38:21.120
Pei Yu leaned
on Physician Song's protection

38:21.200 --> 38:23.080
and looked down on all of us.

38:23.160 --> 38:25.920
Now, because of one prescription,
she has won His Majesty's favor.

38:26.000 --> 38:28.960
All of us who studied for years

38:29.040 --> 38:29.880
feel even more bitter!

38:29.960 --> 38:32.080
So a few days ago, Supervisor Huang

38:32.160 --> 38:34.400
deliberately praised her to the skies
in front of His Majesty,

38:35.080 --> 38:36.560
forcing her to promise

38:36.640 --> 38:38.760
to end the epidemic within half a month.

38:38.840 --> 38:40.120
And if she can't?

38:40.200 --> 38:41.520
If she can't,

38:41.600 --> 38:43.400
then, of course, she'll get kicked out.

38:46.440 --> 38:47.600
As imperial physicians,

38:48.200 --> 38:49.760
instead of stopping the epidemic,

38:50.360 --> 38:53.080
you waste your schemes
bullying your colleagues.

38:53.840 --> 38:56.000
If Huang Futong
really died because of Pei Yu,

38:56.080 --> 38:57.280
then maybe it's fate.

38:57.880 --> 38:59.520
No, Your Ladyship!

38:59.600 --> 39:03.320
You have to save me! Please, save me!

39:11.080 --> 39:12.640
Where would the rope be tied?

39:20.320 --> 39:21.160
No.

39:21.800 --> 39:23.400
The sleeper hasn't moved.

39:23.480 --> 39:25.240
If it were tied to the sleeper,

39:25.320 --> 39:26.760
it'd be hard to pull the rope back.

39:26.840 --> 39:29.320
It must've been something smaller,

39:29.400 --> 39:31.480
lower than the sleeper.

39:35.840 --> 39:37.840
The sleeper's edge has cut marks.

39:37.920 --> 39:39.720
The killer likely cut it
to the right length

39:39.800 --> 39:41.560
to test and balance the weight.

39:44.520 --> 39:45.680
Wait.

40:20.520 --> 40:22.200
How long has it been since you went back?

40:22.840 --> 40:24.080
I haven't kept track.

40:25.920 --> 40:29.000
His Majesty allowed you
to go out openly and treat patients,

40:29.080 --> 40:30.720
but it must still be hard.

40:31.600 --> 40:33.440
I'm still just a woman technician.

40:33.520 --> 40:34.800
His Majesty gave the order,

40:34.880 --> 40:37.040
but those people may not listen to me.

40:37.120 --> 40:38.680
So I have to do everything myself.

40:41.360 --> 40:42.200
Huang Futong is dead.

40:47.800 --> 40:48.920
We're short-handed now.

40:49.000 --> 40:50.320
The Imperial Medical Office
will be even busier.

40:51.000 --> 40:53.040
You don't want to know
how Huang Futong died?

40:56.600 --> 41:00.040
If what you mean is
whether I killed Supervisor Huang,

41:00.640 --> 41:01.560
then I'll tell you now,

41:02.240 --> 41:03.520
it wasn't me.

41:05.880 --> 41:09.000
These days, all I think about
is to keep people alive.

41:10.040 --> 41:11.760
I don't want to see anyone else die.

41:12.720 --> 41:14.840
The epidemic has improved a lot.

41:15.600 --> 41:17.960
The consorts and princes
are getting better,

41:18.040 --> 41:20.640
but the infected servants
are still dying in droves.

41:21.160 --> 41:22.600
I can't stop for even a moment.

41:23.520 --> 41:25.840
Why? Don't you already
have a prescription?

41:26.440 --> 41:30.200
Rhino horn and pearls
are far too rare and expensive.

41:30.280 --> 41:32.800
Ordinary eunuchs and maids
can't get treated.

41:34.000 --> 41:36.720
I want to use common herbs
to make a new prescription,

41:37.960 --> 41:39.520
but I still haven't cracked it.

41:49.760 --> 41:51.800
Your Ladyship, it's all ready!

41:51.880 --> 41:52.960
Keep watch at the entrance.

41:53.040 --> 41:54.040
Understood!

41:58.240 --> 41:59.920
Your Ladyship, begin!

42:06.000 --> 42:08.120
It landed right on the spot
where the millstone fell that day.

42:08.200 --> 42:09.480
This pit.

42:10.320 --> 42:11.200
Looks like we're right.

42:12.640 --> 42:13.760
But…

42:13.840 --> 42:16.560
Where could a rope so long be hidden?

42:17.960 --> 42:20.040
There really wasn't any rope
in the dispensary.

42:24.800 --> 42:25.840
No, Your Ladyship.

42:26.600 --> 42:27.440
Look,

42:27.520 --> 42:29.520
the millstone fell here,

42:29.600 --> 42:31.640
right by the edge of the dispensary door.

42:31.720 --> 42:34.560
But when people go in and out,
they rarely hug the side.

42:35.200 --> 42:36.280
How did the killer know

42:36.360 --> 42:39.320
Supervisor Huang would enter
through this exact spot?

42:41.200 --> 42:42.560
- That cart.
- That eunuch.
